message:
fix(silo): preserve logical line numbers after update change

The preceding commit added three lines to TxExecutor::update. Four
#line directives after that change compensate for lines introduced by
trace formatting so untraced source retains its logical line numbers.
Their fixed values also canceled the three new update lines, causing
TRACE=0 __LINE__ (and the line shown by ERR) to differ from the
untraced source with the update fix.

Increase those four directives by three to restore that identity.
Execution semantics are unchanged; only diagnostic line numbers change.

